B.Ih=s(["Move onto a square held by an opposing piece and you capture it \u2014 the captured piece comes off the board and yours takes its place. Every piece captures exactly the way it moves; there's no separate attacking move.","You can never capture your own pieces. And a captured piece isn't gone for good \u2014 see a few pages from now."],t.s)
