B.IL=s(["A Radial slides any distance in a straight line, two ways: around its own ring, or straight across through the pole to the far side of the board.","Nothing gets a free pass through the center. A piece sitting on the pole blocks a Radial exactly like a piece on any other square \u2014 and can be captured there, same as anywhere else."],t.s)
