B.Jg=s(["The Vector moves two spaces in one direction, then one space to the side. It's a jump: nothing can block it. Pieces in the way \u2014 yours or your opponent's \u2014 are simply leapt over.","Watch how the highlighted landing squares skip straight past the piece sitting one square away, while the piece two rings in gets captured where the Vector actually lands."],t.s)
